v3.0.12

Improved extraction compatibility with Inno Setup, InstallShield, NSIS and RAR SFX installers.
Fixed extraction fallback order and improved file detection.
Added InstallShield CAB signature detection.
Fixed timeout handling in several extraction tools.
Improved archive error handling and batch processing.
Fixed CreateInstall Extractor plugin installation.
Renamed arc_conv.exe to arc_convert.exe.
Improved extraction status reporting for QuickBMS and WCX plugins.